            side by side in the KPI row, one repeated icon reads as a mistake. }}
        <symbol id="mhd-icon-clock" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
