        </symbol>

        {{! ── Row actions ────────────────────────────────────────────────────
            The actions a data table repeats once per row. Spelled out in words
            that is three labels per row and forty rows of the same three words;
            as icons it is a column the eye reads once and then navigates by
            position. See components/_datatable.scss.

            These carry the whole meaning of their button, so the markup that
            uses them must supply an aria-label and a title — the glyph is
            aria-hidden like every other icon in this sprite. }}
        <symbol id="mhd-icon-view" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
